# Check out text files with LF on every OS. DVC hashes raw bytes, so a CRLF checkout
# (Git for Windows' default core.autocrlf=true) changes the md5 of pipeline dependencies
# such as training/*.py and makes `dvc status` report changes that do not exist.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.joblib binary
*.pdf binary
